    "title": "Sear and transfer",
    "text": "Heat oil in a skillet over medium-high. Sear the brisket 5 minutes per side, then transfer to a 4- to 6-qt. slow cooker. Add pepperoncini and juice, ale, broth, and Worcestershire."
