    "title": "Braise 20 minutes",
    "text": "Whisk the wine, ½ cup apple juice, brown sugar and vinegar together and pour it in. Bring it to a simmer over low heat, sit the chops on the cabbage, clamp on a tight lid, and cook 20 minutes. Make the dumplings while it goes."
