    "text": "Whisk ¼ cup cream with the egg in a large bowl, add the bread, and let it soak until saturated. Add the chuck, pork, onion, 1 tsp zest, ½ tsp salt, ¼ tsp pepper, nutmeg and allspice, and mix lightly — overworking it makes them tough."
