    "text": "Melt the butter in a saucepan over medium-high, whisk in the flour and cook 1–2 minutes until it thickens. Work in the defatted liquid gradually, add ¼ cup cream, bring to a boil and simmer about 5 minutes. Finish with lemon juice and season."
